#
# Env tiers, cascaded in dev (see CLAUDE.md "Environment variables"):
#   .env                     — committed, production-safe values, always loaded
#   .env.development         — committed, non-secret dev-only overrides
#   .env.development.local   — gitignored, dev-only secrets (this file's real target)
